BUILD
  index.html  hero with doubled headline and CSS riso cup diagram, 3 features as
              ruled rows with two-ink registration marks, 3 testimonials using the
              generated headshots at 64px with multiply blend, 3 pricing tiers with
              the Golden Child tier stamped "not available to you", blue demo band,
              footer back-link. No external CSS, no build step.
  demo.html   Store Console: 6-table floor plan where only the middle seat is
              selectable, three working filter chips with an empty state, live
              neighbour panel with decibel meters, cup printer that garbles the
              typed name within two characters as you type, and a queue rail that
              inserts a documented firstborn ahead of you every 3.2s with a stated
              reason, plus a hold/resume toggle. Vanilla JS, no frameworks.

WARNINGS / NEAR-MISSES
  - The pink #FF4FA3 is never used for body text against newsprint; it appears only
    as ink fill, offset layer and hatch, with near-black or paper-colour type on top.
    Worth keeping an eye on if this palette is reused.
  - Section seam numbering (S 01/02/03) is kept because the page is staged as a
    printed sheet; feature rows deliberately use registration marks rather than
    numbers, since the three features are not a sequence.
